hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1694","Abu Musa Muhammad bin al-Muthanna narrated to us, saying: Al-Dahhak bin Makhlad informed me, saying: Sufyan informed us, saying: Abdullah bin Abi Bakr informed me, from Sa'id bin al-Musayyib, from Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \O women! When the men prostrate"," guard your eyes.\"" I asked Abdullah: \""From what?\"" He replied: \""From the tightness of the waist-gar"""
